          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Cold vs warm",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "{blue:Cold start} = new environment, runs ==Init== first",
                "{green:Warm start} = reuses an environment, skips Init",
                "Hits: first call after idle, scale-out bursts, new deployments"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Reduce cold starts",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Smaller packages",
                "Node, Python, Go start faster than JVM",
                "Init SDK clients outside the handler",
                "==SnapStart==: Java, Python, .NET",
                "==Provisioned concurrency== keeps environments warm"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "python",
              "lines": [
                "s3 = boto3.client(\"s3\")  # module level, once per environment"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Memory and timeout",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Limit",
                "Value"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Lambda timeout",
                  "3 s default, **15 min** max"
                ],
                [
                  "REST API",
                  "**29 s** default, raise by quota"
                ],
                [
                  "HTTP API",
                  "30 s max"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Memory ==128 to 10,240 MB==; CPU scales with it",
                "More memory = shorter duration, often lower cost",
                "Tune with ==Lambda Power Tuning=="
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Timeout trap",
              "text": "A 15 min function behind a default API fails at ==29 s==."
            },
            {
              "type": "sidebox",
              "title": "Interview Point",
              "items": [
                "**Why can more memory be cheaper?** CPU scales too, so duration drops",
                "**Latency-sensitive API cold starts?** Provisioned concurrency or SnapStart",
                "**What limits an API-fronted timeout?** The API Gateway integration timeout"
              ],
              "ink": "purple"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
