          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. SQS Buffers Work",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Pull queue== that buffers work; Lambda polls it",
                "Batch size: default {blue:10}, up to {blue:10,000} standard, {blue:10} FIFO",
                "Failed message returns after the ==visibility timeout=="
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "sidebox",
              "title": "Stop duplicates and loops",
              "items": [
                "Visibility timeout at least ==6x== the function timeout",
                "Too short: message reappears mid-batch, second copy runs",
                "Add a **DLQ** with `maxReceiveCount`",
                "Poison messages move there and stop looping"
              ],
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. SNS and EventBridge",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**SNS**: push fan-out, one publish reaches Lambda, SQS, HTTP, email",
                "==Filter policies==: each subscriber gets only matching messages",
                "**EventBridge**: rule patterns on a bus route events to targets",
                "Also ==cron/rate== schedules, SaaS and AWS events, schema-based filtering"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Choosing",
